! Tadah cell-convention fixture (castep-5, castep-6).
! The fractional positions come before the lattice, and the lattice is
! given in bohr. Row i of the lattice block is the lattice vector a_i.
kpoint_mp_grid : 2 2 2

%BLOCK POSITIONS_FRAC
Si   0.250   0.500   0.125
O    0.750   0.100   0.600
%ENDBLOCK POSITIONS_FRAC

%BLOCK LATTICE_CART
bohr
   6.0   0.4  -0.2
   2.0   7.0   0.3
  -1.0   1.5   8.0
%ENDBLOCK LATTICE_CART
